Depend on JPype 1.5.2 or later.

PyGhidra 3.1.0 pins JPype1==1.5.2. This package runs on the JPype that
MSYS2 users get here, 1.7.1, and Ghidra's master branch allows it:
GP-7032 changed the pin to >=1.5.2, !=1.6.0, !=1.7.0 for PyGhidra
3.2.0. Backported without the README entry.

Upstream: https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/commit/d5ed9bf9bb7022b91f617e0475fd8b53b1970a6a
Applies-to: all environments

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
     "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14",
 ]
 dependencies = [
-    "Jpype1==1.5.2",
+    "Jpype1 >=1.5.2, !=1.6.0, !=1.7.0",
     "packaging"
 ]
 
